.DS_Store
.venv

# Build artifacts under output/ are ignored — except the rendered
# index.html, the slide-model.json it was rendered from, and any
# images/ they reference, which stay in CI.
talks/*/output/**
!talks/*/output/**/
!talks/*/output/**/index.html
!talks/*/output/**/slide-model.json
!talks/*/output/**/images/**
tests/skills/*/output/**
!tests/skills/*/output/**/
!tests/skills/*/output/**/index.html
!tests/skills/*/output/**/slide-model.json
!tests/skills/*/output/**/images/**

# Working-directory user data. These are created by the orchestrator in a *user's* subject
# directory from the canonical empty forms in schemas/ — they are not bundled assets, and a copy
# committed here ships in every install as a second version of a form that can drift from its
# schema. A dev session run in this repo (which CLAUDE.md tells you not to do) creates them; this
# keeps them out of the commit.
config/profile.md
config/learnings.md
config/feedback-backlog.md
config/feedback-processed.md
config/strict-learnings.md
talksmith-bugs.md
knowledge-library/

.icons/
talks/*/images/.critique/
tests/skills/*/images/.critique/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.claude/settings.local.json
